<div id="literature-review" lang="zh-CN" data-aliases="{{ site.data.literature_review.catalog.historical_aliases | jsonify | escape }}">
  <div class="lr-intro">
    <p class="lr-kicker">READING NOTES <span>持续更新的研究资料库</span></p>
    <p class="lr-lead">从论文出发，找清问题与边界。</p>
    <p class="lr-description">围绕 XR 智能体、创作者与架空世界，以及推理、世界模型与不确定性，记录每篇工作的贡献、方法、结果和实现边界。</p>
    <div class="lr-stats">
      <span><strong>{{ site.data.literature_review.catalog.records }}</strong> 篇论文</span><span><strong>{{ site.data.literature_review.catalog.extracted }}</strong> 篇全文已提取至本机</span><span><strong>{{ site.data.literature_review.catalog.pages }}</strong> PDF页</span
      ><span>更新于 <strong>{{ site.data.literature_review.catalog.updated }}</strong></span>
    </div>
    <nav class="lr-jump-nav" aria-label="文献页导航"><a href="#lr-library">浏览文献</a><a href="#lr-about">阅读说明</a></nav>
  </div>
  <div class="lr-mobile-tabs" role="group" aria-label="工作区视图"><button type="button" data-lr-view="library" aria-pressed="true">文献与笔记</button><button type="button" data-lr-view="chat" aria-pressed="false">论文问答</button></div>
  <div class="lr-workspace">
  <section id="lr-library" aria-labelledby="lr-library-heading">
    <span id="index"></span>
    <div class="lr-section-title">
      <h2 id="lr-library-heading">文献清单 <span>Literature</span></h2>
      <p id="lr-count" role="status" aria-live="polite">158 / 158 份笔记</p>
    </div>
    <form id="lr-filters" class="lr-filters" role="search" aria-label="搜索与筛选文献">
      <label class="lr-search-label" for="lr-search"
        >搜索标题、作者、方法或关键词<input id="lr-search" type="search" placeholder="例如：WorldCoder、因果、clarification…" autocomplete="off"
      /></label>
      <div class="lr-filter-row">
        <label for="lr-topic"
          >研究方向<select id="lr-topic">
            <option value="all">全部方向</option>
            <option value="xr">XR与人机协作</option>
            <option value="creation">创作与规则补全</option>
            <option value="world">世界机制与演化</option>
            <option value="ai">AI方法与评测</option>
          </select></label
        >
        <label for="lr-year"
          >年份<select id="lr-year">
            <option value="all">全部年份</option>
            <option value="2026">2026</option>
            <option value="2025">2025</option>
            <option value="2024">2024</option>
            <option value="2023">2023</option>
            <option value="2022">2022</option>
            <option value="2021">2021</option>
            <option value="2020">2020</option>
            <option value="2019">2019</option>
            <option value="2018">2018</option>
            <option value="1999">1999</option>
          </select></label
        >
        <label for="lr-sort"
          >排序<select id="lr-sort">
            <option value="added">最近收录</option>
            <option value="year">年份由近到远</option>
            <option value="id">编号顺序</option>
            <option value="title">标题 A–Z</option>
          </select></label
        >
      </div>
      <div class="lr-filter-footer">
        <label class="lr-check"><input id="lr-new" type="checkbox" /> 只看近期新增{{ site.data.literature_review.catalog.recent }}份</label><button id="lr-reset" type="button">清除筛选</button>
      </div>
      <div id="lr-noted-filter" hidden><label class="lr-check"><input id="lr-noted" type="checkbox" /> 只看有个人笔记的论文</label></div>
    </form>
    <noscript><p class="lr-notice">当前浏览器未开启JavaScript。仍可展开全部笔记，或用浏览器的查找功能检索。</p></noscript>
    <div class="lr-list-actions"><span>点击标题展开完整笔记</span><button id="lr-collapse" type="button">收起全部</button></div>
    <div id="lr-notes-toolbar" class="lr-notes-toolbar" hidden>
      <span>我的笔记 <span class="lr-muted">· 仅此浏览器</span></span>
      <div class="lr-note-actions">
        <button id="lr-notes-export" type="button" title="导出个人笔记备份">导出备份</button>
        <button id="lr-notes-import" type="button" title="导入个人笔记备份">导入备份</button>
        <input id="lr-notes-file" type="file" accept=".json,application/json" hidden aria-label="选择个人笔记备份">
      </div>
    </div>
    <p id="lr-notes-message" class="lr-note-status" role="status" hidden></p>
    <p id="lr-empty" hidden>没有找到匹配的笔记。试试缩短关键词，或清除筛选条件。</p>
    <div id="lr-papers">
      {% include literature-review/papers-161-170.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-151-160.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-141-150.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-131-140.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-121-130.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-111-120.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-101-110.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-091-100.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-081-090.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-071-080.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-061-070.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-051-060.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-041-050.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-031-040.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-021-030.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-011-020.html -%}
      {%- include literature-review/papers-001-010.html %}
    </div>
  </section>
  <aside id="lr-chat" class="lr-chat" aria-labelledby="lr-chat-heading">
    <div class="lr-chat-heading"><h2 id="lr-chat-heading">论文问答</h2><span id="lr-chat-status" role="status">未连接本机</span></div>
    <details id="lr-chat-connection" class="lr-chat-connection">
      <summary>本机连接</summary>
      <form id="lr-connect-form">
        <label for="lr-bridge-port">端口<input id="lr-bridge-port" type="number" min="1024" max="65535" value="8765" required></label>
        <label for="lr-bridge-token">配对令牌<input id="lr-bridge-token" type="password" autocomplete="off" required></label>
        <button type="submit">连接</button><button id="lr-disconnect" type="button">断开</button>
      </form>
      <button id="lr-local-workspace" type="button">本机工作区</button>
    </details>
    <div class="lr-chat-toolbar">
      <label class="lr-visually-hidden" for="lr-chat-sessions">历史会话</label>
      <select id="lr-chat-sessions" aria-label="历史会话"><option value="">新对话</option></select>
      <button id="lr-chat-new" type="button" title="新建对话" aria-label="新建对话" data-lr-icon="plus"></button>
      <button id="lr-chat-rename" type="button" title="重命名会话" aria-label="重命名会话" data-lr-icon="pencil" disabled></button>
      <button id="lr-chat-export" type="button" title="导出全部问答记录" aria-label="导出全部问答记录" data-lr-icon="download" disabled></button>
      <button id="lr-chat-delete" type="button" title="删除当前会话" aria-label="删除当前会话" data-lr-icon="trash" disabled></button>
    </div>
    <div class="lr-chat-scope"><span>参考论文</span><div id="lr-chat-papers"></div><span id="lr-chat-scope-empty" class="lr-muted">尚未选择</span></div>
    <div id="lr-chat-messages" class="lr-chat-messages" aria-label="会话内容" tabindex="0"><p class="lr-chat-empty">新对话</p></div>
    <p id="lr-chat-error" class="lr-chat-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
    <form id="lr-chat-form" class="lr-chat-composer">
      <label class="lr-visually-hidden" for="lr-chat-question">向 Codex 提问</label>
      <textarea id="lr-chat-question" rows="3" maxlength="12000" placeholder="针对所选论文提问…" required></textarea>
      <div class="lr-chat-send-row"><span id="lr-chat-save-state">历史保存在本机 · Codex 联网回答</span><button id="lr-chat-stop" type="button" title="停止回答" aria-label="停止回答" data-lr-icon="square" hidden></button><button id="lr-chat-send" type="submit" title="发送问题" aria-label="发送问题" data-lr-icon="arrow-up" disabled></button></div>
    </form>
  </aside>
  </div>
  <dialog id="lr-fulltext-dialog" class="lr-fulltext-dialog" aria-labelledby="lr-fulltext-title">
    <header><h2 id="lr-fulltext-title">提取全文</h2><button id="lr-fulltext-close" type="button" title="关闭全文" aria-label="关闭全文" data-lr-icon="x"></button></header>
    <p id="lr-fulltext-status" role="status"></p><div id="lr-fulltext-content"></div>
  </dialog>
  <section id="lr-about" class="lr-about">
    <h2>阅读说明</h2>
    <p>
      摘要、方法与结果依据本地PDF版本整理，部分发表信息另经官方记录核验。结果为论文作者报告，未重跑实验；“作者局限”与资料库的研究判断在正文区分。PDF页码从文件第一页起计。
    </p>
    <p>
      本库每篇论文保留本地最新版；旧版本和完全相同副本已归档，旧编号保留跳转。全文为本机逐页文本层提取，不含图片OCR；公开网站保留摘要，不公开托管全文。
    </p>
    <p class="lr-downloads">
      <a href="{{ '/assets/data' | relative_url }}/literature-review.md" download>下载Markdown笔记</a
      ><a href="{{ '/assets/data' | relative_url }}/literature-review.json" download>下载结构化JSON</a
      ><a href="https://github.com/SoniaSuns/soniasuns.github.io">网站仓库</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
<script defer src="{{ '/assets/js/literature-review.js' | relative_url }}?v={{ site.data.literature_review.catalog.updated }}"></script>
<script defer src="{{ '/assets/js/literature-notes.js' | relative_url }}?v={{ site.data.literature_review.catalog.updated }}"></script>
<script defer src="{{ '/assets/js/literature-chat.js' | relative_url }}?v={{ site.data.literature_review.catalog.updated }}"></script>
